OL,3,AMark Zuckerberg has an image problem -
OL,4,Aso why is Meta's business booming?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Zuckerberg has an image problem -
OL,7,Fso why is Meta's business booming?
OL,9,FMark Zuckerberg was just three minutes
OL,10,Finto his keynote speech at the
OL,11,Fcompany's annual Meta Connect product
OL,12,Fevent last month when his tone turned
OL,13,Falmost wistful.
OL,15,F"Building is an act of love," he said,
OL,16,Fglancing down at the ground with his
OL,17,Fhands in his pockets. "It's how we
OL,18,Fimpart what we believe, and we pour our
OL,19,Fhearts and our souls into what we
OL,20,Fmake."
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
